{{Quote|Since you need to cool off, I vote Big Chill!|Ben to his 10-year-old self as [[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]].<ref name="TFoC">''[[The Forge of Creation]]''</ref>}}
Big Chill has the power of cryokinesis, meaning that he can create and influence the direction and form of the ice that grows from his breath and palms with extreme precision. This allows him to create simultaneous ice constructs that bend and weave through the air before solidifying.<ref name="AaB">''[[Above and Beyond]]''</ref> At his peak capacity, Big Chill was able to completely freeze [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|D'Void]]'s power generator and cause it to crumble apart.<ref name="Voided">''[[Voided]]''</ref>

Big Chill is capable of breathing a wind or beam that can reduce the temperature surrounding it to just this side of absolute zero,{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/3/38/AF_Mini_Bible.pdf Alien Force Series Mini Bible]|group = AF Mini Bible|name = bible}}  turn to ice constructs either mid-air or upon touching a target, or encase a target completely in ice. His breath can also be used as a strong gust of wind without freezing anything, capable of pushing the [[Rustbucket II]] off a cliff.<ref name="KBS">''[[Kevin's Big Score]]''</ref> Big Chill can freeze strong adhesives using his ice breath and make them brittle.<ref name="OPaPP2">''[[Of Predators and Prey: Part 2]]''</ref>

Big Chill is capable of firing freeze rays from his hands.<ref name="Singlehanded">''[[Singlehanded]]''</ref> He can also freeze objects and surfaces just by touching them.<ref name="BoaF">''[[Birds of a Feather]]''</ref><ref name="TT">''[[Tummy Trouble]]''</ref> He can create ice structures by freezing water.<ref name="PH">''[[Plumbers' Helpers]]''</ref>

Big Chill can become intangible and pass through solid matter.{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = Bandai}} He can even cause opponents and objects to freeze by phasing through them if he chooses to.<ref name="MO">''[[Max Out]]''</ref> He can also turn himself partially invisible by becoming intangible.<ref name="KBS" />{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = Bandai}}{{Refn|[[:File:Big Chill Partial Invisibility.png]]|group = MW}}{{Refn|When Big Chill first appeared, he was shown being able to turn invisible.<ref name="KBS"/>{{Refn|group = AF Mini Bible|name = bible}}{{Refn|https://youtu.be/8SR5Xwgvdhg|group = CN}} However, this ability is removed for the rest of his appearances due to being considered an animation error.{{Refn|group = DM|name = link unavailable}}|group = note|name = invisible}}

Big Chill can fly at high speeds with his wings, being able to even outspeed [[Rex Salazar (Generator Rex)|Rex Salazar]] using his [https://generatorrex.fandom.com/wiki/Rex_Salazar%27s_machines#Boogie_pack Boogie Pack.]<ref name="HU">''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Ben 10/Generator Rex: Heroes United]]''</ref> Big Chill is also able to levitate.<ref name="BoaF" /><ref>''[[Duped]]''</ref> Big Chill can also fold up his wings into a hooded robe.

Big Chill possesses sharp claws, which were able to tear through [[Thirteen]]'s suit to remove one of his devices.<ref name="TUH">''[[The Ultimate Heist]]''</ref>

Big Chill has enhanced strength, as seen when he was on a metal-eating spree, where he effortlessly ripped apart a large metal statue and snapped iron girders in half.<ref name="StLD" /> He can also carry a [[Revonnahgander]]<ref name="OPaPP2" /> and a [[Prypiatosian-B Containment Suit]]<ref name="THtH">''[[Too Hot to Handle]]''</ref> while keeping steady flight.

Big Chill's strength extends to his feet, which are prehensile, as [[Freeze-Ghost]] could carry an [[Opticoid (Classic)|Opticoid]] while flying.<ref name="IaMMMBW">''[[It's a Mad, Mad, Mad Ben World: Part 2]]''</ref>

Big Chill is rather durable, as he was able to take a laser blast to the back from [[Kraab (Classic)|Kraab]] and only be slightly fazed.<ref name="TFBP1">''[[The Final Battle: Part 1]]''</ref>

Big Chill is quite agile, as he is capable of dodging attacks while flying, as well avoiding laser attacks from afar, as demonstrated by Freeze-Ghost.<ref name="OPaPP2" />

Big Chill can survive underwater,<ref>''[[Deep]]''</ref> as well as in the vacuum of space.<ref name="TFBP1" /><ref name="TT" />

Big Chill can withstand radiation, such as that generated by a [[Prypiatosian-B]].<ref name="THtH">''[[Too Hot to Handle]]''</ref>

Big Chill is resistant to extreme temperatures, both hot and cold.<ref name="MoI">''[[Map of Infinity (Episode)|Map of Infinity]]''</ref> As such, he can drink molten steel and keep it hot without suffering severe internal damage.<ref name="StLD" />

Big Chill has a powerful jaw capable of chewing up and devouring metal statues, poles, buildings, signs, iron girders, and serving trays.<ref name="StLD" />

Big Chill can generate snow.<ref name="Malefactor" /> Big Chill can also spit out ice shards, as demonstrated by the Necrofriggians on [[Mikd'lty]].<ref name="MoI" />

