==Etymology==
Big Chill comes from the term "big chill", which is an event that occurs when the universe's temperature reaches absolute zero.

==Trivia== 
*Big Chill and [[Swampfire]] are the only aliens whose natural biological behavior has overridden [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s normal state (not counting personality-related ones such as [[Rath (Classic)|Rath]] and [[Juryrigg]]).
*Big Chill closely resembles [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blue_Beetle_(Jaime_Reyes) Blue Beetle, Jaime Reyes] from '''DC Comics'''.
*Throughout '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''', Big Chill's hologram on the [[Omnitrix (Original)|reconfigured Omnitrix]] and [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] is mostly shown in his cloaked form, though there are a few instances where it displays him in his uncloaked form.
*The packaging of Big Chill's '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' figure mistakenly has his name spelled as one word.
*Big Chill tends to make ice-based puns, which was [[Dwayne McDuffie]]'s idea.{{Refn|[[:File:Big Chill Ice Puns.PNG]]|group = MW}}
*Big Chill had concept art drawn by [[Eric Canete]]. In his final design, the back view was created by [[Glenn Wong]], whereas the front view was created by either [[Glen Murakami]] or [[Chap Yaep]], with color styling by Chris Hooten.{{Refn|[https://www.instagram.com/p/B35vmtJA_0e/?img Eric Canete Designed Big Chill Concepts]|group = GW}}
* The idea behind Big Chill's redesign in '''Omniverse''' was to make him more like Man-Bat from '''[[Wikipedia:Batman: The Animated Series|Batman: The Animated Series]]''' in terms of proportion.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Big Chill Inspiration.png]]|group = DJW}}
**Though he did not regret making Big Chill look muscular, Derrick stated that he would consider redesigning him to make him skinny if the fans preferred it.{{Refn|[[:File:DJW Might Redesign Big Chill.PNG]]|group = DJW}}{{Refn|[[:File:DJW Might Redesign Big Chill 2.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Derrick would have designed Benzarro's Big Chill with a skull-like pattern and Nega Ben's Big Chill with a hood.
*Originally, Big Chill was supposed to be used in ''[[Inside Man]]'' to free [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] and [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] from the [[DNAlien]]s' slime.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/2/24/Inside_Man_Script_Outline.pdf/revision/latest ''A Man Inside'' Script Outline]|group = outline}}
*Originally, in ''[[Viktor: The Spoils]]'', after entering the laboratory, Big Chill was supposed to revert back to Ben, but transformed into Big Chill again when the Zarkovian soldiers stormed the room. He was also used to free [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] and [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] from their shackles.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/f/f6/VTS_Script_First_Draft_V1_with_Dwayne%27s_Edits.pdf ''Viktor: The Spoils'' Script First Draft with Dwayne McDuffie's Edits (First Version)]|group = script|name = first1}}
*In the first draft of the script for ''[[The Flame Keepers' Circle]]'', Big Chill displayed the ability to turn invisible.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/6/66/TFKC_Script_First_Draft.pdf ''Keepers of the Flame'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = script 1}}{{Refn|group = note|name = invisible}}
*Big Chill was originally not supposed to appear in the dream in ''[[Night of the Living Nightmare]]''.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/d/d4/Night_of_the_Living_Nightmare_Script_First_Draft.pdf ''Night of the Living Nightmare'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = first}}
*When asked about Big Chill's sex, the crew had differing views: 
**Dwayne McDuffie believed Big Chill is "sort of" female.{{Refn|''link unavaliable''|group = DM|name = link unavailable}}
**[[Matt Wayne]] sees him as definitely female.{{Refn|[[:File:Big Chill Definitely Female MW.png]]|group = MW}}
**[[Derrick J. Wyatt]] thought he could be like a male [[Wikipedia:Seahorse|seahorse]].{{Refn|[[:File:Big Chill Male Seahorse.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*Big Chill is one of [[Dee Bradley Baker]]'s favorite aliens to voice, the other being [[Spidermonkey (Classic)|Spidermonkey]].{{Refn|[[:File:DBB's Favorite Aliens to Voice.png]]|group = DBB}}

